// English commands for `generate_assessment` (34 cases).
//
// Spread deliberately across the slot-completeness space, because completeness
// is what drives the policy: 0 required slots missing -> prefill, exactly 1 ->
// ask, 2 or more -> prefill again (the form is the question). All three regions
// are represented; a corpus of only fully-specified utterances would report a
// policy that was never exercised.
//
// `profile` is omitted on most cases, which means an EMPTY profile. That is a
// measurement decision: with no profile defaults, any `grade`/`subject`/
// `language` in the result came from the utterance or from memory and never
// from a fallback, so a hallucinated slot cannot hide behind a plausible
// default. The profile path gets its own dedicated cases below.

